{"type": "tweet", "id": "1995840503997431900", "url": "https://x.com/mediaindonesia/status/1995840503997431900", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mediaindonesia/status/1995840503997431900", "text": "Soal Desakan Status Bencana Nasional, Ketua MPR: Pemda Mampu Tangani Situasi

Ketua MPR Ahmad Muzani menilai pemerintah pusat belum perlu menetapkan status bencana nasional terkait musibah di Aceh, Sumatra Utara, dan Sumatra Barat. Menurutnya, pemerintah daerah (pemda) masih mampu menangani situasi di wilayah masing-masing bersama pemerintah pusat.

“Pemerintah bisa mengendalikan situasi dan keadaan secepatnya, dan sekarang sedang dilakukan bersama pemda kabupaten, kota, dan provinsi,” ujar Muzani saat ditanya mengenai desakan masyarakat agar Presiden menetapkan status darurat bencana nasional, di Kompleks Istana Kepresidenan, Jakarta Pusat, Selasa (2/12). #Statusbencananasional #Banjirbandang #KetuaMPR #AhmadMuzani #Prabowo", "source": "", "retweetCount": 1, "replyCount": 2, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 624, "createdAt": "Tue Dec 02 13:00:31 +0000 2025", "lang": "id", "bookmarkCount": 0, "isReply": false, "inReplyToId": null, "conversationId": "1995840503997431900", "inReplyToUserId": null, "inReplyToUsername": null, "isPinned": false, "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "mediaindonesia", "url": "https://x.com/mediaindonesia", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/mediaindonesia", "id": "68930552", "name": "Media Indonesia", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2013862868442054656/PHgXw1vG_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/68930552/1768990893", "description": "", "location": "Jakarta - Indonesia", "followers": 1614320, "following": 82, "status": "", "canDm": true, "canMediaTag": true, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 26 08:17:20 +0000 2009", "entities": {"description": {"urls": []}, "url": {}}, "fastFollowersCount": 0, "favouritesCount": 232, "hasCustomTimelines": true, "isTranslator": false, "mediaCount": 109856, "statusesCount": 978875, "withheldInCountries": [], "affiliatesHighlightedLabel": {}, "possiblySensitive": false, "pinnedTweetIds": [], "profile_bio": {"description": "Akun Twitter Resmi Media Indonesia | Referensi Bangsa | #EditorialMI", "entities": {"description": {"hashtags": [{"indices": [56, 68], "text": "EditorialMI"}]}, "url": {"urls": [{"display_url": "mediaindonesia.com", "expanded_url": "http://www.mediaindonesia.com/", "indices": [0, 23], "url": "https://t.co/gIjpFPpVx6"}]}}}, "isAutomat